Every unit other than LB is now treated as kilograms. Cascade Mills sends short tons (`MEA*PD*G*11.2*TN` in tests/fixtures/partners/cascade_856.edi, line 9), so an 11.2 ton load would be stored as 11.2 kg. Handle the units we know and fail loudly on the rest, so the file goes to quarantine instead of into billing:

```python
if unit == "LB":
    value = value * LB_TO_KG
elif unit == "TN":
    value = value * TON_TO_KG
elif unit != "KG":
    raise ManifestParseError(f"unsupported weight unit {unit!r} in MEA segment")
```

with `TON_TO_KG = Decimal("907.18474")` next to `LB_TO_KG`.

